<title>BELGIUM: Fortis AG raises 1996 profit forecast.</title>
<headline>Fortis AG raises 1996 profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian insurance company Fortis AG said on Thursday it expected 1996 earnings per share to rise at least 10 percent, compared with a previous forecast of more than seven percent.</p>
<p>Fortis AG, which together with Fortis AMEV controls Fortis, the Belgian-Dutch Fortis financial services group, said earnings per share in the nine months to September 30 rose 15 percent to 266 Belgian francs. Net profit was up 21 percent at 10.05 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
